{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "capability": "calculations",
  "description": "The calculations authoring-lane cross-check corpus: 12 cases derived from the frozen calculations behavior map's anchor set (compile bridge, admission fence, rule-graph). Each case is driven through BOTH packed authoring lanes (@harborline-software/rule-authoring over @harborline-software/rule-engine, and Harborline.Foundation.RuleAuthoring over Harborline.Foundation.RuleEngine); each lane asserts the pinned expected verdict AND the engine lane cross-checks verdict identity against the renderer lane's written verdicts, case by case. Drafts are the authoring-model JSON; expression values are raw JSON (the .NET lane stringifies for its RuleDefinition wire shape).",
  "cases": [
